   6. use the Software or any part of it to create a competing product or to move boards into services other than
      Convyy;
   7. use the Software in violation of applicable law or of the terms of the services you export boards from.

   Viewing this repository on GitHub, and any copy GitHub itself creates through its features, is subject to the
